You could try one of the many MUDD/MUSH clients, most of which do
precisely what you're asking for above. I use TinyFugue for this,
but a basic list of such clients can be found on the website for
my favourite MUSH at http://www.amush.cx/clients.html if you wish
to check them out.

Best wishes from Riley.
